-- database/migrations/README.md (file marker)
--
-- Database migrations for the Cross-Border Remittance Platform.
-- Target: Supabase / PostgreSQL.
--
-- Planned tables (not yet implemented):
--
--   users              — sender and recipient profiles (no raw PII in cleartext)
--   transactions       — core remittance transaction records
--   transaction_events — append-only event log per transaction
--   route_selections   — historical route choices and their outcomes
--   compliance_checks  — KYC/AML check results (references only, no raw docs)
--   blockchain_records — references to on-chain settlement records
--   fx_rate_snapshots  — FX rates captured at transaction time for auditability
--
-- Naming convention: 000_description.sql (zero-padded sequential)
-- Run with: supabase db push  OR  psql -f <file>
